tunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.986" end="1:15.426">信</span><span begin="1:15.426" end="1:15.696">じ</span><span begin="1:15.696" end="1:16.186">てる</span><span begin="1:16.186" end="1:16.816">の</span><span begin="1:16.816" end="1:17.486">は</span><span begin="1:17.826" end="1:18.466">君</span><span begin="1:18.466" end="1:19.536">だ</span><span begin="1:19.536" end="1:21.176">け</span></p><p begin="1:21.722" end="1:25.543" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.722" end="1:21.932">愛</span><span begin="1:21.932" end="1:22.062">し</span><span begin="1:22.062" end="1:22.372">てん</span><span begin="1:22.372" end="1:22.492">よ</span><span begin="1:22.492" end="1:22.752">音</span><span begin="1:22.752" end="1:23.092">色</span> <span begin="1:23.432" end="1:23.672">You're</span> <span begin="1:23.672" end="1:24.052">my</span> <span begin="1:24.052" end="1:24.832">ba</span><span begin="1:24.832" end="1:25.543">by</span><span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="1:25.489" end="1:26.270">(ba</span><span begin="1:26.270" end="1:28.011">by)</span></span></p><p begin="1:27.241" end="1:32.601" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.241" end="1:27.621">誰</span><span begin="1:27.621" end="1:27.771">よ</span><span begin="1:27.771" end="1:27.911">り</span><span begin="1:27.911" end="1:28.071">も</span><span begin="1:28.071" end="1:28.451">ずっ</span><span begin="1:28.451" end="1:28.641">と</span><span begin="1:28.871" end="1:29.001">あ</span><span begin="1:29.001" end="1:29.271">な</span><span begin="1:29.271" end="1:29.661">た</span><span begin="1:29.661" end="1:30.111">で</span><span begin="1:30.111" end="1:30.341">い</span><span begin="1:30.341" end="1:31.141">て</span><span begin="1:31.141" end="1:31.761">all</span> <span begin="1:31.761" end="1:32.601">right</span></p><p begin="1:32.910" end="1:37.430" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.910" end="1:33.090">愛</span><span begin="1:33.090" end="1:33.240">し</span><span begin="1:33.240" end="1:33.530">てん</span